        "official_en_sha256": "12817f08491dd57065e3c98f0bf910a11c18d48fe28c4ebd50f9deb51d178572"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここにいる兵士はみんな\r\nヘスのために命をかけて戦っている。\r\n最高の仲間であり、僕の誇りなんだ。",
        "official_en": "Every soldier here risks their life to fight for Hess. They are my beloved companions, and I could ask for no finer comrades-in-arms.",
        "real_en": "Every soldier here risks their life fighting for Hess. They're the best comrades I could ask for, and I'm proud of them."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
